{"unit_id":"catsenior507__dsh-policy-strict-gate#feature-1","repo":"catsenior507/dsh-policy-strict-gate","commit":"79d0cf81860be6b82842d8fe1af65e7eb21b0df1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Policy Strict Gate 的功能「重复失败提醒」：在工具结果中发现失败后，按工具、失败类别和错误特征累计同类次数，达到阈值时将带有建议的提醒排入后续步骤。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/gate.js:501-553","lib/signature.js:20-111"]}
{"unit_id":"catsenior507__dsh-policy-strict-gate#feature-2","repo":"catsenior507/dsh-policy-strict-gate","commit":"79d0cf81860be6b82842d8fe1af65e7eb21b0df1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Policy Strict Gate 的功能「关键路径规格门控」：工具准备写入受 glob 保护的已有文件时，先查找并检查对应 Lean 规格；未获接受时拒绝写入并附上诊断，已有诊断对应的修复写入可以通过。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/gate.js:212-304","lib/gate.js:324-357"]}
{"unit_id":"catsenior507__dsh-policy-strict-gate#feature-3","repo":"catsenior507/dsh-policy-strict-gate","commit":"79d0cf81860be6b82842d8fe1af65e7eb21b0df1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Policy Strict Gate 的功能「写后语法检查」：每次受支持工具成功写入后，根据文件语言运行检查器，并把诊断作为上下文返回；检查器不可用时也会告知未完成检查。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/gate.js:465-499"]}
{"unit_id":"catsenior507__dsh-policy-strict-gate#feature-4","repo":"catsenior507/dsh-policy-strict-gate","commit":"79d0cf81860be6b82842d8fe1af65e7eb21b0df1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Policy Strict Gate 的功能「策略状态查询」：通过 strict_gate_status 工具查询三类闸门是否启用及其计数，也可用 targets 操作检查给定路径匹配的保护规则。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/status.js:16-32","lib/status.js:88-124","lib/index.js:263-276"]}
{"unit_id":"catsenior507__dsh-policy-strict-gate#feature-5","repo":"catsenior507/dsh-policy-strict-gate","commit":"79d0cf81860be6b82842d8fe1af65e7eb21b0df1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Policy Strict Gate 的功能「规格结果联动」：当 strict_check 被调用时，插件自行复查 Lean 文件并记录通过状态或诊断，让受保护目标的后续写入按规格结果放行或进入修复流程。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/gate.js:394-459"]}
{"unit_id":"catsenior507__dsh-policy-strict-gate#caveat-1","repo":"catsenior507/dsh-policy-strict-gate","commit":"79d0cf81860be6b82842d8fe1af65e7eb21b0df1","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Policy Strict Gate 使用前须知：关键路径写入门控默认关闭，因为 criticalPaths 默认为空；写后检查和该门控还需要单独安装 strict-check 协作插件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/config.js:8-24","lib/index.js:70-103","cordis.patch.yml:30-35"]}
